#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Timers window manages session-only scheduled commands. Open it from Tools > Timers, the Start menu, toolbar Options > Timers, or by typing /timer with no arguments. It is a desktop window: drag, resize, minimize to its taskbar button, or press Escape to close it. Closing discards any unsaved draft."
msgstr ""
"The Timers window manages session-only scheduled commands. Open it from "
"Tools > Timers, the Start menu, toolbar Options > Timers, or by typing "
"/timer with no arguments. It is a desktop window: drag, resize, minimize to "
"its taskbar button, or press Escape to close it. Closing discards any "
"unsaved draft."

